<title>USA: SkyTel offers pre-set paging service.</title>
<headline>SkyTel offers pre-set paging service.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SkyTel Corp, a subsidiary of Mobile Telecommunications Technologies Corp, said on Tuesday it would offer a new paging service which allows consumers to buy the service based on a pre-determined number of pages.</p>
<p>The firm said the service, which would eliminate the need for monthly bills and recurring fees, is targeting those consumers who may want to use a pager occasionally but do not want to pay the monthly fees.</p>
</text>
